3. Derived Stats (Scale with base stats, level, and factors)
Core Combat Stats
Derived Stat	Formula
HP	(CON × 12) + (Level × 8) + (Size_HP_Mod × Base_HP) + Race_Bonus
Mana	(INT × 10) + (Level × 5) + (CHA × 2) + Race_Bonus
Speed	5 + (AGI × 1.5) + (Level × 0.5) + Size_Speed_Mod + Age_Speed_Mod
Physical Attack	(STR × 3) + (AGI × 1 if finesse else 0) + (Level × 1.5) + Weapon_Base
Magical Attack	(INT × 4) + (PER × 1) + (Level × 1.2) + Focus_Item_Bonus
Armor	(CON × 1.5) + (STR × 0.5) + Gear_Armor + Size_Armor_Mod
Magical Resist	(INT × 1.2) + (CHA × 1) + (Level × 0.8) + Race_Bonus + Gear_Resist
Dodge Chance	Base 5% + (AGI × 0.5%) + (PER × 0.25%) + (Level × 0.2%) - Size_Dodge_Penalty
Crit Chance	(AGI × 0.3% physical) + (PER × 0.4% all) + (Level × 0.15%)
Crit Damage	150% base + (INT × 1%) + (Level × 0.5%)
Important Caps & Diminishing Returns (for balance)
Dodge cap: 50% (modified by size: Tiny can reach 65%, Huge max 40%)

Damage reduction from Armor: Soft cap at 60% (Armor/(Armor + 200))

Magical Resist cap: 70%

Crit Chance cap: 40%

